# Header produksi untuk Cloudflare Pages / Netlify (docs/01 §1d).
#
# Tanpa dua header pertama, `crossOriginIsolated === false` dan
# SharedArrayBuffer tidak tersedia → aplikasi jatuh ke degraded mode.
# `require-corp` berarti semua sub-resource lintas origin harus opt-in
# (CORP/CORS): self-host font, gambar, dan artefak WASM.

/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff

/*.wasm
  Content-Type: application/wasm
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
